From: Shimazu <vanessimbolon2020@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 31 Jul 2026 02:19:04 +0000
Subject: HealCommandEvent: Replace SchedulerUtils.runTaskLater with player EntityScheduler

AE PATCH REASON: SchedulerUtils.runTaskLater makes code incompatible with Folia region-threaded architecture and crashes at runtime (UnsupportedOperationException from stripped SchedulerUtils).
AE PATCH FIX: Replace SchedulerUtils.runTaskLater with target.getScheduler().runDelayed(EffectsHandler.getInstance(), task, null, 1L) for post-/heal armor and held-item rechecks. Rename obfuscated vars (event, message, args, target, slot, item).
AE PATCH RISK: LOW - MIGRATE: SchedulerUtils → Player EntityScheduler. RF: var rename. No behavior change.

